&_nc_oc=AdrVECoo9Sqmk94B9IADJZ87GFdshC1m0aRHU4vyOEDA6IxHp0UakGj5cUR9t0jZEqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD0xctiU1AL6PHMKQXBjCmkfL4PaiH5rVoczCIE4QA_HQ&oe=6A53AFBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FlJH4-2etO0Q7kNvwGAT8NS&_nc_oc=AdryuW0_QEPi9136I_rQUnB7HYwwpxdXcPgCytDzESfdDz_CabTzD6Gno284CD_Px1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBrGgrvLJx7H-Wxbp_C21b9_THIcDPbdSlDapv-fSPZ1g&oe=6A53887C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S1k0knvBbzQQ7kNvwFUQoDY&_nc_oc=AdpYDrdWJ8yiAPQSG5r2YIXMd-fQ6o1_B1Td0Z6OuuyCWmNLnvJ2lclbnB3l0n2KQac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB9EOkRdbr_66xsw_baAYUNNKpOQPZ1r491euKnutIUFw&oe=6A53A707"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=miCz6-DRJXcQ7kNvwFEsSWk&_nc_oc=AdoHyO6F2aQDXV6WSCeIs8N6oxePNo5glJTMcTbGcbBIvuAuK5zpUHCE81eMtIbWsSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCqB6T4p5npKw3UFDDxvsvDmYMDeO1shsVY-l3LNiIiGA&oe=6A5392D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q-nIyuwGmeoQ7kNvwEsE0rs&_nc_oc=AdpGiKWAUnC_H_Xf4i39_ZodGJopbKJSh_LjEwUFDaQw9CJlY9AFQb4xcgRpm3sGepA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB5BYVQtKsDrRZSA9JYlyuuWonDypVPiWIPYK4q4RP-RA&oe=6A539F64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.